# Solreign Chef CQC ("kitchen brigade discipline") — same register as martial-arts.ftl/judo-belt.ftl.
# Grant is wear-conditioned (apron on = certified, apron off = decertified); each combo finisher
# gets one loud popup on each side.

# Heat Check (swat, swat): battle cry above the wearer...
solreign-chef-heat-check-user = { $user } shouts "HEAT CHECK, COMING THROUGH!" with full kitchen authority!

# ...and the outcome above the target (stamina jolt only).
solreign-chef-heat-check-target = { $target } receives two rapid corrections to their kitchen posture.

# 86'd (swat, toss): knockdown.
solreign-chef-eighty-sixed = { $target } has been 86'd. Please exit through the swinging doors.

# Order Up (toss, toss): the held item flies.
solreign-chef-order-up = Order Up sends { $target } { THE($item) } right out of their hands.

# Order Up with nothing left to take: the ticket still counts.
solreign-chef-order-up-empty = Order Up finds { $target } already empty-handed. Ticket closed anyway.
